I stand in the kitchen.
It is very quiet in the new flat.
Suddenly, there is a knock at the door.
I go into the hallway and open the door.
My neighbor, Frau Krüger, stands in front of the door.
She has a small plant in her hand.
"A gift for the new flat, Ms. Flores," she says.
"Thank you very much, Frau Krüger!"
"Please come in," I say.
We go into the living room.
Frau Krüger looks around.
My backpack is still lying on the floor.
My jacket is hanging on the hook.
It is still a bit messy.
But Frau Krüger just smiles.
We put the plant by the window.
Now the plant stands on the windowsill.
It stands exactly next to the laptop.
"That looks very cozy," says Frau Krüger.
"Yes, I really feel comfortable here," I answer.
